    "Question #: 3": {
      "Title": "Exam 70-735 topic 1 question 25 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You are testing the push-button reset feature."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "When you attempt to recover a computer, you discover that after each restart, the computer enters the Installing Windows phase."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You discover that a third-party antivirus application is captured in the customization package."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You need to modify the image to ensure that the push-button reset can complete successfully."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What should you do first?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Run scanstate.exe and specify the /hardlink parameter."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Copy the subfolders of the Windows Assessment and Deployment KIT (Windows ADK) files from the User State Migration Tool (USMT) and Windows Setup."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. In the Scanstate configuration file, modify the Migrate attribute for the antivirus application."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Run dism.exe and specify the /Cleanup-Wim and /Cleanup-MountPoints parameters."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: B \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Vote_count": []
    },
    "Question #: 4": {
      "Title": "Exam 70-735 topic 1 question 26 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You deploy an image of Windows 10."
          },
          {
